    "detailed_description": "<h1>PLAY THE DEMO FIRST!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678350/extras/2e9e59cff75775d0cdbac09a7977f30b.avif?t=1752642421\" data-has-big width=800 height=260 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678350/extras/d64193ef611fce229c09f8c29fead44c.avif?t=1752642421\" data-has-big width=800 height=190 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>As We Unite</strong> is a political strategy simulation game where you play as a newly appointed Consul in a secretive global cult. Your mission: unite the fractured nations of the world before an unpredictable endgame calamity strikes. Rather than ruling a single country, you operate from the shadows\u2014managing agents, manipulating diplomacy, and carefully influencing global powers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678350/extras/7ff2a26b59b91397eb7eac17e09ac2a1.poster.avif?t=1752642421\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678350/extras/7ff2a26b59b91397eb7eac17e09ac2a1.webm?t=1752642421\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678350/extras/7ff2a26b59b91397eb7eac17e09ac2a1.mp4?t=1752642421\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world is on the brink. Tensions rise. Crises loom. And you\u2019re the only one with a plan to bring humanity together\u2026 or reshape it entirely.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You begin in the cult\u2019s command room, promoted to the rank of Consul. Your orders come through a flickering monitor running <strong>UniteOS</strong>, the cult\u2019s proprietary operating system. From there, you send agents across a fractured world, nudging nations toward unity\u2014or submission.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each country has unique traits and is part of a broader coalition. Some are friendly, others hostile. As you gain control, unrest rises, and managing larger populations becomes harder. Random events, shifting alliances, and emerging threats force you to adapt constantly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678350/extras/72bf4fb1c9d5cec067c4796dc2165521.poster.avif?t=1752642421\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678350/extras/72bf4fb1c9d5cec067c4796dc2165521.webm?t=1752642421\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678350/extras/72bf4fb1c9d5cec067c4796dc2165521.mp4?t=1752642421\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play as a cult</strong>, not a country \u2014 send agents, rig elections, and influence nations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Every run ends with a unique global crisis</strong> \u2014 from pandemics to AI uprisings.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Manage resources across the world</strong> \u2014 balance power, unrest, and strategy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Retro-futuristic setting</strong> \u2014 operate from a 1950s dream of a secret underground HQ.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple endings</strong> \u2014 unite the world, survive the calamity, or bring it all down.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you aim to save humanity or reshape it in your image, the world won\u2019t wait.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unite, before it's too late. </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678350/extras/2e9e59cff75775d0cdbac09a7977f30b.avif?t=1752642421\" data-has-big width=800 height=260 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wishlist now to get notified when the free demo comes out!</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678350/extras/d64193ef611fce229c09f8c29fead44c.avif?t=1752642421\" data-has-big width=800 height=190 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>As We Unite</strong> is a political strategy simulation game where you play as a newly appointed Consul in a secretive global cult. Your mission: unite the fractured nations of the world before an unpredictable endgame calamity strikes. Rather than ruling a single country, you operate from the shadows\u2014managing agents, manipulating diplomacy, and carefully influencing global powers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678350/extras/7ff2a26b59b91397eb7eac17e09ac2a1.poster.avif?t=1752642421\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678350/extras/7ff2a26b59b91397eb7eac17e09ac2a1.webm?t=1752642421\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678350/extras/7ff2a26b59b91397eb7eac17e09ac2a1.mp4?t=1752642421\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world is on the brink. Tensions rise. Crises loom. And you\u2019re the only one with a plan to bring humanity together\u2026 or reshape it entirely.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You begin in the cult\u2019s command room, promoted to the rank of Consul. Your orders come through a flickering monitor running <strong>UniteOS</strong>, the cult\u2019s proprietary operating system. From there, you send agents across a fractured world, nudging nations toward unity\u2014or submission.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each country has unique traits and is part of a broader coalition. Some are friendly, others hostile. As you gain control, unrest rises, and managing larger populations becomes harder. Random events, shifting alliances, and emerging threats force you to adapt constantly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678350/extras/72bf4fb1c9d5cec067c4796dc2165521.poster.avif?t=1752642421\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678350/extras/72bf4fb1c9d5cec067c4796dc2165521.webm?t=1752642421\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678350/extras/72bf4fb1c9d5cec067c4796dc2165521.mp4?t=1752642421\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play as a cult</strong>, not a country \u2014 send agents, rig elections, and influence nations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Every run ends with a unique global crisis</strong> \u2014 from pandemics to AI uprisings.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Manage resources across the world</strong> \u2014 balance power, unrest, and strategy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Retro-futuristic setting</strong> \u2014 operate from a 1950s dream of a secret underground HQ.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple endings</strong> \u2014 unite the world, survive the calamity, or bring it all down.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you aim to save humanity or reshape it in your image, the world won\u2019t wait.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unite, before it's too late. </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678350/extras/2e9e59cff75775d0cdbac09a7977f30b.avif?t=1752642421\" data-has-big width=800 height=260 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wishlist now to get notified when the free demo comes out!</strong></p>",
